  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mini Hydropower Plants in the Rural Areas Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is to provide a reliable supply of electricity in rural areas of Tajikistan where supply is limited during summer, and, especially, in winter periods owing to a combination of generating capacity problems during peak periods of demand, energy availability constraints and transmission system supply constraints.</narrative>
  </description>
